multidecoy_RECOMB_supp.pdf - Supplementary to the paper "Multiple Competition-Based FDR Control and Its Application to Peptide Detection" by Kristen Emery, Syamand Hasam, William Stafford Noble, and Uri Keich.  Published in RECOMB 2020.

corrections.pdf - reporting identified errors

multicomp_0.2.0.tar.gz - the multicomp R package that implements some of the methods discussed in the paper